700,"type":"courier","id":"c148","house":"rhino","letter":"L186","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":2700,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":442,"t":2700,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1834,"retries":0},{"seq":443,"t":2700,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 10. Orchid has a truce. My doctrine suggests making a friend. I should try to offer a truce to Orchid now. Rhinos are active near F1 (West Ford). I should use decoys and hunt enemy riders as per doctrine."},{"seq":444,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c149","house":"kite","letter":"L187","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","rhino-camp"],"depart":2700,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":445,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c150","house":"kite","letter":"L188","kind":"letter","to":"orchid-camp","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2","s-mid","south-village","orchid-camp"],"depart":2700,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":null},{"seq":446,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c151","house":"kite","letter":"L189","kind":"decoy","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":2700,"plain":"BOWMEN, ATTACK AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":447,"t":2700,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1873,"retries":0},{"seq":448,"t":2700,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"The kite truce is active. My focus shifts to consolidating position and gathering intelligence. Rhino is at F1 (West Ford). Tiger is massing at S-Mid. I will move my archers and elephants to F1/S-West to pressure Rhino and secure the ford, while scouting the general situation."},{"seq":449,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c152","house":"orchid","letter":"L190","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":2700,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":450,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c153","house":"orchid",